		border-radius: 64rpx;
		background-color: #b05a3a;
		display: flex;
		align-items: center;
		justify-content: center;
		box-shadow: 0 8rpx 24rpx rgba(176, 90, 58, 0.35);
	}
	.record-hint {
		position: absolute;
		left: 0;
		right: 0;
		top: 1074rpx;
